@host = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. Request OTP
POST {{host}}/auth/register/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.new@ku.th",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 2. Verify OTP (เอา OTP จาก terminal backend log มาแทน)
POST {{host}}/auth/register/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.new@ku.th",
  "otp": "000000"
}

### 3. Login (ใช้ email/password ที่สมัครผ่าน OTP flow ข้างบนแล้วเท่านั้น)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.new@ku.th",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### 4. Login ผิดรหัสผ่าน -> expect 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.new@ku.th",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}
